Description:
[size=3][b]Summary:[/b][/size]
<br />
<br />"Radical Raiders" takes most of the valley's (and beyond) monsters and changes them to be more unique and, in rare cases, visually appealing.
<br />Several of these monsters have been given sprite variants because I felt like it. Those who haven't might get some in the future. We'll see.
<br />
<br />In addition to the antagonistic monsters, I've also completely redesigned [b]Krobus[/b] to be more consistent with the other shadow beings. Might wanna check if any mods alter the sprites, though. Better be safe than sorry.
<br />The ominous [b]Sea Monster[/b] has also gotten a makeover. If you dislike either the Krobus or Sea Monster designs, you can toggle between different versions of the Krobus 14-heart event spritesheet.
<br />
<br />These redesigns are off by default in the config, y'know, just to be safe.
<br />
<br />Due to the mod using Monster Variety to load monster textures for the purpose of compatibility with other MV mods, any instance of a monster in events and festivals will have it's original, Vanilla texture. To combat this, you can toggle a small list of monsters I've provided:
<br />
<br />[list]
<br />[*](Green) Slime;
<br />[*]Mummy;
<br />[*]Skeleton;
<br />[*]Shadow Brute;
<br />[*]Stone Golem;
<br />[*]Wilderness Golem;
<br />
<br />[*]Pepper Rex.
<br />[/list]
<br />The following monsters have been changed:
