<br />[i][u]Monsters that have texture variants.
<br />[/u][/i]★ Dangerous counterparts included.
<br />☆ Dangerous counterparts (with variants) included.
<br />
<br />The remaining monsters (crabs and false magma caps) will not be changed in the foreseeable future due to visual conflicts with mods that change nodes and/or magma caps. I'm sorry. Kinda.
<br />
<br />Oh, and the little tendrils on the male slimes' antennae are meant to be fingers. The dangerous variant is rocking out. Hard.
<br />
